        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. Lateral Transfer and Bumping Procedure - Any employee who has been notified that he/she will actually be laid off may file with his/her appointing authority, within five (5) working days of receipt of such notice, a written request to laterally transfer to a position in the same title and/or bump to a lower title in accordance with the provisions in this subsection:",
